going to loads





OUT



10 kΩ to GPIO 34, and 10 kΩ from GPIO 34 to GND (divider). ESP32 ADC max is 3.3 V; ACS712 OUT is ~2.5 V at 0 A on 5 V supply so the divider is extra safety.

Zero-current voltage is about 2.5 V. Sensitivity for 30 A module is 66 mV/A.





