Power-up checklist





Fuses out. DMM continuity: no 12 V short to GND.



LM2596 out = 5.00 V.



Insert 5 A fuse. ESP32 boots, OLED shows splash.



Insert 20 A fuse. Controller shows battery voltage.



Uncover panel at noon; solar amps rise.



Spin turbine by hand; XL6009 out stays ~14.4 V; diode is warm, not hot.



Cover LDR → lamps click on.



Phone → SmartPole-AP → http://192.168.4.1





Faults







Symptom



Likely cause





ESP32 brown-out



5 V sag; heatsink LM2596, thicker wire





OLED blank



SDA/SCL swapped; address 0x3C vs 0x3D





Relay always on



Active LOW vs HIGH; invert in code





INA219 reads 0



VIN+ / VIN− not in series; current > 3.2 A saturates





Battery not charging from wind



XL6009 below battery voltage; missing diode; turbine open





Smell / heat on inverter



Purifier too large; stop and use 12 V fan

